 "hook": "Come run Fonte with me in Lagos, Portugal. I never would have guessed that I had a fit of base in Portugal until my new friend and fellow Ironman",
 "transcript_start": "Come run Fonte with me in Lagos, Portugal. I never would have guessed that I had a fit of base in Portugal until my new friend and fellow Ironman triathlete Tiago sent me a message saying that if I host a run club meet up, that he would come out and bring me a mattress. So, naturally, I'm quite intrigued. I've got 9 days left in Portugal and on this Sunday, November 8th, I'm going to be hosting a run club meet up in Lisbon. I usually hate running",
